Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 10:20:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix all critical frontend code + add leave/kick RPCs

Frontend changes:
- KampeTab: joinMatchWithTeam now uses join_match RPC (atomic,
  server-side capacity check + status update)
- KampeTab: leaveMatch now uses leave_match RPC (atomic,
  handles creator handoff server-side)
- KampeTab: kickPlayer now uses kick_player_from_match RPC
- KampeTab: confirmResult guards against double-click with busyId check
- HomeTab: fetchFeed now checks for DB errors instead of destructuring
  blindly, preventing crash on network failure

SQL additions:
- leave_match RPC: atomic leave with creator handoff
- kick_player_from_match RPC: atomic kick with creator/admin check

